  <note>
    <title>Missouri Statewide Council on Sex Trafficking and Sexual Exploitation of Children | Office for Victims of Crime (OVC)</title>
    <created>20221128T164841Z</created>
    <updated>20221201T152638Z</updated>
    <note-attributes>
      <source>web.clip7</source>
      <source-url>https://dps.mo.gov/dir/programs/cvsu/council.php</source-url>
      <source-application>webclipper.evernote</source-application>
    </note-attributes>
    <content>
      <![CDATA[<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="no"?>
<!DOCTYPE en-note SYSTEM "http://xml.evernote.com/pub/enml2.dtd"><en-note><div style="display:none;--en-chs:&quot;eyJpc0VtcHR5Ijp0cnVlfQ==&quot;"> </div><ul><li><div>Data to collect and analyze</div></li><ul><li><div>CD reports made under 210.115</div></li><li><div>Info from phone calls to National Sex Trafficking Hotline</div></li><li><div># reports made to law enforcement</div></li><li><div>arrests</div></li><li><div>prosecution rates</div></li><li><div>other data important for recommendations to the council</div></li></ul></ul><div><br/></div><div>Called Sarah Bernstein - Shared Hope - have her tell us why SH is still rating us where they are and get them to get up</div><ul><li><div>get Ed Shared Hope memo - Sydney</div></li></ul><div><br/></div><div>Reached out to CATE - had data, not uploaded</div><div><br/></div><div>Rep Caucus at noon, meeting at 10:30 - 1 hour meeting - HR2</div><ul><li><div>look at data - </div></li></ul><div><br/></div><div>Agenda: </div><ul><li><div>look at data we have - have someone from SH give us their take on what legislative things we need</div></li><li><div>Discuss / Question why we got the score we got, what can we do to improve</div></li><li><div>25 minutes for SH / 20 minutes for data</div></li></ul><div><br/></div><div><span style="--en-highlight:green;background-color: #b7f7d1;">present my data</span></div><ul><li><div><span style="--en-highlight:green;background-color: #b7f7d1;"><span style="--en-markholder:true;"><br/></span></span></div></li></ul><div><br/></div><div>Also bills:</div><ul><li><div>licensing - less restrictions</div></li><li><div>protection of children</div></li><li><div>Wage Theft</div></li><ul><li><div>Kent Hayden, Ed </div></li></ul></ul><div><br/></div><div style="--en-task-group:true; --en-id:cb4787ee-7ca9-4f9f-8bd4-063c1f9d1087;--en-content-hash:dfc0ecdefe810348bf7e9e44cbbaa9aa;-webkit-user-modify:read-only;-moz-user-modify:read-only;user-modify:read-only;border-radius:3px;border:1px solid rgba(182,182,182,0.09);background:rgba(174,174,174,0.09);overflow:hidden;color:#868686"><div style="background:rgba(182,182,182,0.09) no-repeat 6px 6px url(&quot;data:image/svg+xml;base64,&quot;);padding:8px 38px;font-weight:600">Content not supported</div><div style="padding:2px 6px;margin: 1em">This block is a placeholder for Tasks, which has been officially released on the newest version of Evernote and is no longer supported on this version. Deleting or moving this block may cause unexpected behavior in newer versions of Evernote.</div></div><div><br/></div><div style="--en-clipped-content:fullPage; --en-clipped-source-url:https://dps.mo.gov/dir/programs/cvsu/council.php; --en-clipped-source-title:Missouri Statewide Council on Sex Trafficking and Sexual Exploitation of Children | Office for Victims of Crime (OVC);">
<div><br/></div><div style="z-index:200; position: relative;">CST Webpage 11/28/22<hr/></div><div style="min-height: 2962px; font-size: 16px; display: block; min-width: 100%; position: relative;"> <div style="font-family:sans-serif;text-size-adjust:100%;box-sizing:border-box;font-size:10px;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);"><div style="box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Tahoma, Geneva, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.42857;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);">
<div style="box-sizing:border-box;position:relative;min-height:44px;margin-bottom:20px;border:1px solid transparent;border-color:rgb(47, 65, 90);background:linear-gradient(rgb(58, 81, 112) 0%, rgb(58, 81, 112) 24%, rgb(30, 58, 98) 100%);border-radius:0px;">
  <div style="box-sizing:border-box;margin-right:auto;margin-left:auto;padding-left:15px;padding-right:15px;width:1170px;">
    <div style="box-sizing:border-box;margin-left:-15px;margin-right:-15px;">
      <div style="box-sizing:border-box;float:left;min-height:105px;width:100%;">
        <a href="https://dps.mo.gov/" style="box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration:none;float:left;font-size:18px;line-height:20px;font:0px / 0 a;text-shadow:none;border:0px;background-color:transparent;font-weight:bold;color:rgb(255, 255, 255);margin-left:-15px;height:auto;padding:0px;position:relative;">Department of Public Safety<en-media type="image/png" hash="b0565076122544c67f50cc73a9b8ce9e" width="435" height="111" style="border:0px;box-sizing:border-box;vertical-align:middle;min-height:1px;padding-left:15px;padding-right:15px;float:left;display:block;position:absolute;top:0px;left:0px;width:465px;" /></a>

          
         
        <div style="box-sizing:border-box;position:relative;min-height:1px;float:left;width:58.3333%;left:41.6667%;background:url(https://dps.mo.gov/css/../img/diag_pat_trans.png) repeat rgb(65, 91, 129);top:7px;right:20px;height:40px;display:block;padding:0px 10px 0px 0px;border-radius:3px;">
          <div style="box-sizing:border-box;margin-left:-15px;margin-right:-15px;">
            <div style="box-sizing:border-box;min-height:1px;padding-right:15px;width:66.6667%;top:5px;display:block;position:relative;padding-left:0px;float:left;">  
              <h2 style="box-sizing:border-box;font-family:&quot;Francois One&quot;, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-weight:500;line-height:1.1;color:rgb(68, 68, 68);margin-top:20px;margin-bottom:10px;font-size:22px;position:absolute;width:1px;margin:-1px;padding:0px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0px, 0px, 0px, 0px);border:0px;">Quick Navigation</h2>
